    ": screening (spec keys, source allowlist, injected keys at any depth, wrong value kinds), sentinel leak scan over every output byte, coverage split, roll provenance, the 20-digit ARN prefix join, address cap, slivers flagged and never dropped (every input link row reaches output), a non-boolean sliver value refused, the layer id alias, compact ",
    {
     "children": [
      "gaps"
     ],
     "tag": "code"
